  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "来交换彩色螺丝咯～\n来换卡娜莉玩偶咯～<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67654EA463625F69827287BA4E1D54AFFF5E000A6765636253615A1C838973A9507654AFFF5E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你有彩色螺丝，\n我可以用卡娜莉玩偶跟你交换。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6067095F69827287BA4E1DFF0C000A621153EF4EE5752853615A1C838973A950768DDF4F604EA4636230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "交换",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EA463620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "红色卡娜莉玩偶啊。\n据说它能让经验值增加哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EA2827253615A1C838973A95076554A3002000A636E8BF45B8380FD8BA97ECF9A8C503C589E52A054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金色卡娜莉玩偶啊。\n据说它能让钱增加哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D1827253615A1C838973A95076554A3002000A636E8BF45B8380FD8BA994B1589E52A054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉红色卡娜莉玩偶啊。\n据说它能让超级碎片增加哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C897EA2827253615A1C838973A95076554A3002000A636E8BF45B8380FD8BA98D857EA7788E7247589E52A054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "绿色卡娜莉玩偶啊。\n据说它能让你<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n更容易地顶住宝可梦的招式哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EFF827253615A1C838973A95076554A3002000A636E8BF45B8380FD8BA94F6000100001BE00000A66F45BB96613573098764F4F5B9D53EF68A6768462DB5F0F54E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蓝色卡娜莉玩偶啊。\n据说它能让你更容易地捉住宝可梦哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84DD827253615A1C838973A95076554A3002000A636E8BF45B8380FD8BA94F6066F45BB96613573063494F4F5B9D53EF68A654E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是来干什么的啊？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F67655E724EC04E487684554AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎哟！你得到所有种类的\n卡娜莉玩偶啦～！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那么我来告诉你一个有用的消息！\n如果你把剩下的彩色螺丝全部拿来，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我会用巨大卡娜莉玩偶跟你交换哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "剩下的彩色螺丝\n还有<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004>个。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果你把剩下的彩色螺丝全部拿来，\n我会用巨大卡娜莉玩偶跟你交换哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52694E0B76845F69827287BA4E1D000A8FD8670900100002020100044E2A300200100001BE01000A5982679C4F60628A52694E0B76845F69827287BA4E1D516890E862FF6765FF0C000A62114F1A75285DE8592753615A1C838973A950768DDF4F604EA4636254E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你把彩色螺丝全部拿来啦！\n那么巨大卡娜莉玩偶就送给你了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我会把它送到你房间哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60628A5F69827287BA4E1D516890E862FF67655566FF01000A90A34E485DE8592753615A1C838973A950765C3190017ED94F604E86FF0100100001BE00000A62114F1A628A5B83900152304F60623F95F454E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨大卡娜莉玩偶\n已被送到旅馆Z的房间！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE8592753615A1C838973A95076000A5DF288AB9001523065C59986005A7684623F95F4FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你已经得到所有卡娜莉玩偶了，\n没必要再来这里了吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605DF27ECF5F9752306240670953615A1C838973A950764E86FF0C000A6CA15FC58981518D67658FD991CC4E865427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "收集到彩色螺丝之后，\n可要再来哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653696C652305F69827287BA4E1D4E4B540EFF0C000A53EF8981518D676554E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大量的卡娜莉周边。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592791CF768453615A1C838954688FB930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦麻麻鳗鱼王它们的玩偶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A69EBB9EBB9CD79C7C738B5B834EEC768473A9507630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦对战和游戏都很棒啊。\n就算是小孩，只要战胜大人就能得到赞赏。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A65BF96218548C6E38620F90FD5F8868D2554A3002000A5C317B97662F5C0F5B69FF0C53EA8981621880DC59274EBA5C3180FD5F9752308D5E8D4F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "估价可是很重要的。\n千万别嘴上说好就完事！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F304EF753EF662F5F8891CD898176843002000A53434E07522B56344E0A8BF4597D5C315B8C4E8BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把螺丝变成彩色这道工序，\n其实意外地需要技巧哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A87BA4E1D53D862105F6982728FD990535DE55E8FFF0C000A51765B9E610F591657309700898162805DE754E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让脚手架成为速力酷，\n其实也是为了让密阿雷的大家开心！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9811A624B67B662104E3A901F529B9177FF0C000A51765B9E4E5F662F4E3A4E868BA95BC6963F96F7768459275BB65F005FC3FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是你这位卡娜莉狂热问答王的话！\n相信也能够胜任全息投影卡娜莉吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F4F608FD94F4D53615A1C838972C270ED95EE7B54738B76848BDDFF01000A76F84FE14E5F80FD591F80DC4EFB5168606F62955F7153615A1C83895427FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全息投影卡娜莉是为了\n应付奇怪粉丝而诞生的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但我演着演着就乐在其中了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5168606F62955F7153615A1C8389662F4E3A4E86000A5E944ED85947602A7C894E1D800C8BDE751F76842026202600100001BE00000A4F4662116F1477406F1477405C314E50572851764E2D4E86FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "彩色螺丝来自于\n我们的玩乐之心！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n如果有快乐的回忆，就会爱上那座城市。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F69827287BA4E1D676581EA4E8E000A62114EEC768473A94E504E4B5FC3FF0100100001BE00000A5982679C67095FEB4E50768456DE5FC6FF0C5C314F1A72314E0A90A35EA757CE5E02300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来有大工程要开始了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6765670959275DE57A0B89815F0059CB4E86FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真想让全世界都知道脚手架速力酷……不对，\n是真想让全世界都知道卡娜莉的魅力啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F60F38BA951684E16754C90FD77E59053811A624B67B6901F529B9177202620264E0D5BF9FF0C000A662F771F60F38BA951684E16754C90FD77E5905353615A1C838976849B45529B554A300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有粉丝因为爷爷扮的全息卡娜莉而高兴，\n这真的让我感到心情复杂啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67097C894E1D56E04E3A72377237626E76845168606F53615A1C8389800C9AD85174FF0C000A8FD9771F76848BA96211611F52305FC360C5590D6742554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐净她就是\n会把什么事都往身上揽的人啊～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9051C059795C31662F000A4F1A628A4EC04E484E8B90FD5F808EAB4E0A63FD76844EBA554AFF5E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你呀……偷看主播的屏幕\n可是很失礼的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605440202620265077770B4E3B64AD76845C4F5E55000A53EF662F5F885931793C768454E63002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是放着棱镜塔不管的话，\n密阿雷的大家可就无法欢笑了吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F653E774068F1955C58544E0D7BA176848BDDFF0C000A5BC6963F96F7768459275BB653EF5C3165E06CD56B227B114E8654273002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想通过来电伍让密阿雷变得更有趣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3901A8FC7676575354F0D8BA95BC6963F96F753D85F9766F467098DA33002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    }
